# Correct a human pawn promotion's piece choice while PROMOTION_WAIT is
# active. _do_validate_move() always resolves promotion ambiguity to queen
# (all four promotion move-types share an identical vision footprint, so
# there's no way to tell them apart from the board diff alone) — this lets
# the human tell the system what they actually placed before confirming via
# the clock. Only valid while GS.PROMOTION_WAIT is active for a human
# promotion (not the computer's).
string piece  # 'q', 'r', 'b', or 'n' (case-insensitive)
---
bool success
string message
